## Attribution note / 致谢与来源说明

This project's **design thinking** was inspired by
[AIHOT](https://github.com/KKKKhazix/AIHOT) (MIT License, by KKKKhazix) —
specifically the idea of "a framework that finds its own hot topics and writes
your daily briefing; swap the sources and selection criteria, and it becomes
your industry's news site."

**This codebase is an independent implementation, not a fork of AIHOT.**
It shares no source code with AIHOT:

| | AIHOT | This project |
|---|---|---|
| Language | TypeScript | Python 3.11 |
| Architecture | DB + API + Worker, Docker, SSR web | Single-process script pipeline, no web |
| Output | Website | Email + Feishu + Markdown vault |
| Positioning | Public industry hotspot site | Internal daily briefing for one company |

Credit for the original concept belongs to AIHOT's author. Any bugs in this
implementation are ours alone.

本项目**设计思路**受 [AIHOT](https://github.com/KKKKhazix/AIHOT)（MIT）启发，
但代码为独立实现，**不是 AIHOT 的 fork**，两者不共享任何源码。
